Package: DOMformulaR
Title: Reproducible CHONPS Formula Assignment and Visualization for DOM
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("xiaowu20", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "wlymusic@qq.com")
Description: Imports ultrahigh-resolution mass spectrometry peak tables,
    assigns candidate molecular formulae restricted to carbon, hydrogen,
    oxygen, nitrogen, phosphorus, and sulfur, calculates formula-level
    dissolved organic matter indices, compares samples, and produces
    publication-ready visualizations. Accurate-mass assignments are
    candidate annotations and are not structural identifications.
